{
    "word": "humorist",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "d5bbd6ec-e5f6-383a-a40e-fd6aeafa22a6",
                "word": "humorist",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "cd4f541d-ae9c-436d-b731-e3a9e0079168",
                        "entry_id": "d5bbd6ec-e5f6-383a-a40e-fd6aeafa22a6",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "humorists"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "921e3853-f8ac-3494-95a3-86760e67cb8e",
                        "entry_id": "d5bbd6ec-e5f6-383a-a40e-fd6aeafa22a6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Someone who believes that health and temperament are determined by bodily humours; a humoralist."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "archaic",
                            "historical"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "996e9ef1-4c3d-351f-9ba7-47df102cf7ee",
                        "entry_id": "d5bbd6ec-e5f6-383a-a40e-fd6aeafa22a6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Someone subject to whims or fancies; an eccentric."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "obsolete"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "92732578-17f7-40e7-a7a6-e8eea824b4c0",
                                "sense_id": "996e9ef1-4c3d-351f-9ba7-47df102cf7ee",
                                "text": "She and the duke used to rally me upon my fondness for lord W—m, who was a sort of an humourist, and apt to be in a pet, in which case he would leave the company, and go to bed by seven o'clock in the evening."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "04135115-27a9-4576-a358-50d9c6ff4953",
                                "sense_id": "996e9ef1-4c3d-351f-9ba7-47df102cf7ee",
                                "text": "I called on him and found him a contemporary of Beauclerk and Langton at Trinity College, Oxford, and a man of reading and animation, but a kind of humourist."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e2786f25-9bc3-342c-aa15-219f8d590005",
                        "entry_id": "d5bbd6ec-e5f6-383a-a40e-fd6aeafa22a6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A humorous or witty person, especially someone skilled in humorous writing or performance."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4b980096-5c5a-4ebe-bdc3-51c51b631bf4",
                                "sense_id": "e2786f25-9bc3-342c-aa15-219f8d590005",
                                "text": "Peter, after the manner of man at the breakfast table, had allowed half his kedgeree to get cold and was sniggering over a letter. Sophia looked at him sharply. The only letter she had received was from her mother. Sophia's mother was not a humourist."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "48cd56bc-3dee-4eb4-9aff-62aee9c7141e",
                                "sense_id": "e2786f25-9bc3-342c-aa15-219f8d590005",
                                "text": "Art Buchwald, who satirized the follies of the rich, the famous and the powerful for half a century as the most widely read newspaper humorist of his time, died Wednesday night in Washington."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "58bcd043-6a43-499d-ad48-d9c12279a073",
                                "sense_id": "e2786f25-9bc3-342c-aa15-219f8d590005",
                                "text": "But when it comes to conveying what made these people funny, what impact they had in their day and, especially, what debt they are owed by present-day humorists, Johnson doesn’t put much meat on the old bones."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "788da9bd-6d57-3da8-abaa-6d6572176df7",
                        "entry_id": "d5bbd6ec-e5f6-383a-a40e-fd6aeafa22a6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One who studies or portrays the humours of people."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3508f7e9-d876-4202-bbbb-3c8491f94779",
                        "source_entry_id": "d5bbd6ec-e5f6-383a-a40e-fd6aeafa22a6",
                        "source_sense_description": "writer of humor",
                        "target_lang_word": "humoriste",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "humoriste",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "92987b6e-b833-3be3-a156-603e0abe28c5",
                                        "entry_id": "20c35543-1418-3fc1-b7ba-e45912801130",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Écrivain ou acteur spécialisé dans l’humour et le comique."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de2ab69b-2235-483c-a0e6-4979c3fa7c1a",
                                                "sense_id": "92987b6e-b833-3be3-a156-603e0abe28c5",
                                                "text": "Nous savons que ce sont les représentations qui déclenchent tout le désarroi ; le secret de l’humoriste est de causer ce désarroi par des images qui, au premier abord, paraissent s’exclure."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d748786f-6867-4c92-a96d-83254f44dcc3",
                                                "sense_id": "92987b6e-b833-3be3-a156-603e0abe28c5",
                                                "text": "On se taille facilement un joli petit rôle d’humoriste sublime en isolant avec soin les menus incidents, en truquant, trichant, ne prenant de toute cette grosse affaire que les infimes ricochets."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7395c40-b01b-4372-9f2c-4f1120eb0b27",
                                                "sense_id": "92987b6e-b833-3be3-a156-603e0abe28c5",
                                                "text": "La perspective d'accroître son capital personnel par l'investissement lui rappela irrésistiblement la maxime d'un célèbre humoriste : « Celui qui est parti de rien pour arriver à pas grand-chose, disait Pierre Dac, ne doit rien à personne ». C'était évidement son cas."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "afe7e071-2f7c-4418-85ae-2eae4db736d4",
                                                "sense_id": "92987b6e-b833-3be3-a156-603e0abe28c5",
                                                "text": "Mais la figure de la quarante-huitarde en culottes partage dans l’imagination des humoristes la place avec des révoltées enjuponnées, montrant sans pudeur leurs jambes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "humoriste",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0c87b208-dcad-3581-96c4-f8bebae38abd",
                                        "entry_id": "f2ef317e-bba2-3704-b7d5-87275c024d50",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui a de l’humour."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd7535dc-8e57-4d3b-9c9c-723dfd2399bc",
                                                "sense_id": "0c87b208-dcad-3581-96c4-f8bebae38abd",
                                                "text": "Un écrivain humoriste."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e45815a-3132-46dd-8de1-f2e96a23ea7c",
                                                "sense_id": "0c87b208-dcad-3581-96c4-f8bebae38abd",
                                                "text": "On ne devient pas écrivain comme ça, par hasard. Moi, si. Comme j’étais devenu maçon, comme j’étais devenu dessinateur « humoriste » – je mets humoriste entre guillemets parce que ça vous a un petit air tout à la fois cucul-la-praline et prétentieux qui appelle les guillemets."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9837d58c-0656-3ba4-8063-3a25f5437646",
                                        "entry_id": "f2ef317e-bba2-3704-b7d5-87275c024d50",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Se disait d'une personne grincheuse, souvent de mauvaise humeur. ^([1])  ^([2])  ^([3])"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "aa67581f-d363-41d5-98a4-6f690379781e",
                        "source_entry_id": "d5bbd6ec-e5f6-383a-a40e-fd6aeafa22a6",
                        "source_sense_description": "writer of humor",
                        "target_lang_word": "Humorist",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Humorist",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a2999069-c70f-3dd0-8754-5c3736b563c1",
                                        "entry_id": "9ea1dfe9-fcc5-32a8-a56f-4b3e2f0e1838",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Person, die komische Werke verfasst und /oder komödiantische Aufführungen darbietet"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ffa52fb5-67b9-4b01-8244-7cb1d7b0650a",
                                                "sense_id": "a2999069-c70f-3dd0-8754-5c3736b563c1",
                                                "text": "Vicco von Bülow alias Loriot gilt als einer der bedeutendsten deutschen Humoristen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bfecd7ef-573b-4667-80e2-5f9577308cf2",
                                                "sense_id": "a2999069-c70f-3dd0-8754-5c3736b563c1",
                                                "text": "„Der tragische Humorist macht sich selbst zugleich zum Zuschauer; er kommt zu einer Distanz von sich selbst.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "07fc82cc-eb10-40ea-bb10-8fd8fc76e70b",
                                                "sense_id": "a2999069-c70f-3dd0-8754-5c3736b563c1",
                                                "text": "„Es ist wenig bekannt, daß auch Königsberg in Preußen seinen eigenen stadtbekannten Humoristen hatte: Robert Johannes.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da2bf9fd-cb2e-48d3-a909-edaa15cf0164",
                                                "sense_id": "a2999069-c70f-3dd0-8754-5c3736b563c1",
                                                "text": "„Mark Twain, der große amerikanische Humorist und Erzähler, hat einmal die sicher weise Feststellung getroffen, dass im Himmel nicht gelacht würde.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f6121f8b-6303-4018-a483-6600e064577d",
                                                "sense_id": "a2999069-c70f-3dd0-8754-5c3736b563c1",
                                                "text": "„Den Humoristen und Komikern in diesen Kabaretts war es großzügig gestattet, Witze über heilige Institutionen zu machen, sogar über die Götter selbst.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
